        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive, earn, and dominate the city streets in <i>City Taxi Mission</i> — a mission-based taxi driving game with endless fun!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into your yellow cab, pick up passengers, and drop them at their destinations across a bustling 3D city. Every successful fare earns you money to upgrade your fleet and unlock new taxis. Whether you're cruising through downtown traffic or weaving past buses and bikes, each mission challenges your reflexes, timing, and road sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚕 <strong>City Taxi Mission</strong> blends fast-paced arcade driving with the satisfaction of casual progression. Perfect for fans of urban driving games, taxi sims, and short-session gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚖 <strong>Drive and Deliver</strong> – Pick up and drop off passengers across an open city environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Mission-Based Gameplay</strong> – Complete multiple passenger drop missions in each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Earn and Upgrade</strong> – Unlock new taxis with the money you earn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛞 <strong>Smooth Driving Experience</strong> – Designed for casual players and driving enthusiasts alike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌆 <strong>3D Urban Environment</strong> – Explore traffic-filled city roads with buses, cars, tucks and pedestrians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔓 <strong>Achievement System</strong> – Unlock Steam achievements as you rise through the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Singleplayer</strong> – Fully offline, no internet required</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to rule the roads?</strong><br>Start your engine and take on the challenge in <i>City Taxi Mission</i> — where every ride counts!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive, earn, and dominate the city streets in <i>City Taxi Mission</i> — a mission-based taxi driving game with endless fun!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into your yellow cab, pick up passengers, and drop them at their destinations across a bustling 3D city. Every successful fare earns you money to upgrade your fleet and unlock new taxis. Whether you're cruising through downtown traffic or weaving past buses and bikes, each mission challenges your reflexes, timing, and road sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚕 <strong>City Taxi Mission</strong> blends fast-paced arcade driving with the satisfaction of casual progression. Perfect for fans of urban driving games, taxi sims, and short-session gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚖 <strong>Drive and Deliver</strong> – Pick up and drop off passengers across an open city environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Mission-Based Gameplay</strong> – Complete multiple passenger drop missions in each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Earn and Upgrade</strong> – Unlock new taxis with the money you earn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛞 <strong>Smooth Driving Experience</strong> – Designed for casual players and driving enthusiasts alike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌆 <strong>3D Urban Environment</strong> – Explore traffic-filled city roads with buses, cars, tucks and pedestrians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔓 <strong>Achievement System</strong> – Unlock Steam achievements as you rise through the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Singleplayer</strong> – Fully offline, no internet required</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to rule the roads?</strong><br>Start your engine and take on the challenge in <i>City Taxi Mission</i> — where every ride counts!</p>",
        "short_description": "🚖 Pick up passengers, complete missions, and upgrade your taxi in this fast-paced city driving game. City Taxi Mission is a casual, singleplayer experience built around smooth controls, quick fares, and endless urban action.",
